        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.86,
          "end": 4.67,
          "en": "Let's now have a quick bonus about how password exploration works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.67,
          "end": 11.96,
          "en": "This is a bonus to indicate that you can easily skip this lecture because it's not that important and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.96,
          "end": 14.09,
          "en": "it's not required for the rest of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.09,
          "end": 17.81,
          "en": "So let's get to this bonus about password exploration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.81,
          "end": 22.64,
          "en": "So let's say we want to expire the password of Lauren.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.64,
          "end": 27.71,
          "en": "So the way to go would be that I just log in as another user, for example, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.74,
          "end": 33.08,
          "en": "Now I should be logged in and we can see here, I don't want to update, I don't want to do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.08,
          "end": 33.47,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.47,
          "end": 34.85,
          "en": "And this is my shell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.85,
          "end": 40.43,
          "en": "It has opened automatically here, luckily, so I don't need to open it again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.88,
          "end": 49.19,
          "en": "I now want to make the password of Lauren expire so I can change the password with the password command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.07,
          "end": 56.52,
          "en": "And I could say, okay, the minimum password age should be seven days and the maximum password age,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.52,
          "end": 58.41,
          "en": "for example, should be 30 days.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.65,
          "end": 63.21,
          "en": "So she should be forced to change her password every 30 days.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "I could now just hit enter and this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 71.1,
          "en": "I need to enter my password again because I use sudo here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.1,
          "end": 77.09,
          "en": "So I need this additional permission this or my user here has the right to use sudo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 77.1,
          "end": 82.56,
          "en": "So I'm able to do this and we can see here something hasn't worked because I need to specify.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 82.59,
          "end": 85.08,
          "en": "I shouldn't specify that for myself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 85.38,
          "end": 87.66,
          "en": "I should specify that for Lawrence.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 87.66,
          "end": 92.25,
          "en": "So I need to add this parameter and then I can hit enter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.25,
          "end": 96.6,
          "en": "And now we can see that the password expiry information has been changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
